{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee18e0eed481b8cdb1284ecdfe6abc0f68b2affcffe6fa403514786c86861db5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見て見て！\n新しい衣装、どうかな？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，快看快看！\n这套新服装，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c483b3d6eca5b029ce2c1ade5aaffd30290dbb37ace36c0356af2329cd1506df", "ja": "おっ、試着してたんだな。\nうん、よく似合ってるじゃないか。", "zh": "哦，原来你在试穿啊。\n嗯，很适合你嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "ad3e497e349d043da3f881583dcb9a7262b90efcfe244a537cae4308d83af979", "ja": "えへへ。この衣装、すっごく動きやすいの！\nイー・アル・サン！　ほらね、カンフーもばっちり。", "zh": "嘿嘿。这套服装穿起来特别方便活动！\n一、二、三！你看，功夫也练得有模有样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1003_p", "source_sha256": "72e3108d1743cabb7f68576af4967ae4b67550c8c0d39e2dc8a5b2533d6514c1", "ja": "そうだな、いい感じだ。", "zh": "是啊，感觉不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "a7a0204a3c90dc748d722d48e4b7de8a8fac6dfa32d9e164805128dc6e30cca7", "ja": "わたし、すごく気に入っちゃった！\nそれで、衣装に合わせて、髪型もかえてみたよ。", "zh": "我超级喜欢的！\n所以就配合服装，把发型也换了一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "10e230fd587ab36900c73cb60c5cdabe733d7ab63cdc46ec546272a78d5089b4", "ja": "パンダっぽい髪のまとめかたにしてみたんだけど……。\nど、どうかなあ？", "zh": "我试着把头发扎成熊猫风格……。\n怎、怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a3ce0d0181a9a107737d1d0272b5560ef96fc9fa28da07f786ad86fcfc9ddc4c", "ja": "ああ、そっちも似合ってると思うよ。\nすごくカワイイよな。", "zh": "啊，我觉得那样也很适合你。\n真的很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "fb65070af933006b6ecf2f1307c67c70b61931d5940c0976a4c3c5fee05b0904", "ja": "か、かわいい……そっかぁ。う～ん。\nやっぱりそうなんだ？", "zh": "可、可爱……这样啊。嗯——\n果然是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cf412ed92dad98c1fd3be5d5a9231be400b31b5f09a27a9a32c3f93015abd224", "ja": "えっ、何か気になるのか？", "zh": "咦，你是在意什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "99f8a0e17fdd037649db7dae3b41a6399e5049394e27aa2fc9c5abd7f8682e80", "ja": "だって、かわいいって、子どもっぽいって\nことでしょ？　ちょっとイヤかも……。", "zh": "因为，说可爱，就是说像个小孩子吧？我可能有点不喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e820514834fa588c24d4554a2691df504892f678d35b66628984733c38f3b53", "ja": "今よりうんと子どもの頃、たまにおかあさんに、\nこういうパンダヘアーにしてもらってたんだ。", "zh": "在比现在小很多的时候，妈妈偶尔会帮我梳成这种熊猫发型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a19b842156bd52e83f7efb9b5562231609b9e582b88f086928d4eeae379452b", "ja": "今日の衣装もちょっとパンダがはいってるし、\nまたやってみたんだけど……やめようかなぁ……。", "zh": "今天的服装里也有一点熊猫元素，\n所以我又试着弄了一下这样的发型……还是算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0f77f6cdb541de2e4e435bcf2d954c096bbc1f7a7c6f79b0b319a4cb517b952a", "ja": "うーん？　まあ確かに、\n大人っぽい印象はあんまりないかもだけど……。", "zh": "嗯——？确实，虽然可能不太给人成熟的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "e7dc6ef90a534721c86778208f22e5a913d76ad514cb655849d04212659695ff", "ja": "やっぱり！　うぅ……。", "zh": "果然是这样！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f0b5152a228de8c11e18dd373c38e67b776c280e2cbbbea431ea45db9bb564ce", "ja": "でも、今カワイイって言ったのは、\n子どもっぽいって意味じゃないぞ。", "zh": "不过，我刚才说可爱，\n可不是说你孩子气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cd2f5699d86b69b96cf6c3065cb8eed6a1c57ef7eb572d4d1b8333e219286e77", "ja": "カンフーっぽい凛々しさもあって、\nカッコイイとも思ったし。", "zh": "还有种功夫般的飒爽，我也觉得很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "2a0abb827fbca2fd486148d4b22de74dce9d8396e573a9893a252e4fa9a31976", "ja": "えっ、ほんとに？　カッコいい？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？很帅气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5b77d3b4e87d6cce49b341b92696bb817e69e08ab015cee4a5450a1a30ac49d0", "ja": "ああ！　だからその髪型でいってみよう。", "zh": "是啊！所以就用这个发型试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "16b8e299e89f53d429ada8663ce246ea7bb5d3b8b72b9680f0550125720afd64", "ja": "うん、わかった。カッコいいならいいよ。", "zh": "嗯，我知道了。只要帅气就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0274_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "0576f4573ecc89a279b1dcd758a07cec6642379eef214dca9f3c2a31148d0253", "ja": "髪型、すっごくまよったけど、\nこれにきめてよかった～♪　えへへ……。", "zh": "发型让我纠结了好久，不过最后决定用这个，真是太好了～♪　嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
